  "note": "The classic copla of 1933-1958, singer by singer: Concha Piquer, Estrellita Castro, Imperio Argentina, Miguel de Molina, Angelillo, Juanita Reina, Gracia de Triana, Manolo Caracol, Lola Flores, Antoñita Moreno, Antonio Molina, Marifé de Triana, Juanito Valderrama and Rafael Farina, most of it by Quintero, León and Quiroga. Each recording is a track on a compilation titled for the copla (Rise's 180-track Antología de la Copla, Warner's Las 101 grandes Coplas); whether each is the singer's original recording is not stated, so release years are left empty and the second year is the year the Spanish Wikipedia list gives for the song's première. Songs already in the pasodoble playlist (El relicario, Mi jaca, Francisco Alegre, Campanera, Suspiros de España, En tierra extraña) are left out on purpose.",
